  source_shape:
    NxN bounding box where N = 3-5, containing 6-10 pixels (density 0.40-0.70)
    not a filled rectangle; need not be connected (1-2 components) [observed]
    not fully 4-fold symmetric [observed, to make the task non-trivial]
  layout:
    source occupies exactly the TL quadrant relative to marker (r < marker_top, c < marker_left)
    source bbox bottom-right corner is diagonally adjacent to marker top-left corner (gap = 0)
    no source pixel shares a row or column with the marker
  margins:
